## Summary Checklist for Mathematical Threat Modeling

| Mathematical Concept | Security Application | Goal |
|---|---|---|
| Graph Theory | State Transition Mapping | Force non-linear step variations to break business order tracking. |
| Set Theory | Dependency Matrix Auditing | Find dangerous overlapping variable contexts in third-party code. |
| Boolean Algebra | Truth Table Testing | Pass payload arrays to disrupt logical evaluation gates on the server. |

